  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Leaderboard,GFX Online 排行榜能力包:榜单生命周期/分数提交与累加策略/周边与置顶查询/对局结算投影(Match.Settled 订阅+幂等+失败重投)+ admin handlers(query_leaderboard). Leaderboard capability package for the GFX Online family: board lifecycle, score submission with sum/best policies, around and top queries, the match-settled projection with idempotency and retry, and admin handlers. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
